  "description": "JSON document and JSON projection of native JTV2 share the declared fields. Native kinds, logical credits, framing and authoritative terminal are verified separately; a JSON projection cannot establish those properties. make/cmake execution receipt. Diagnostics are a bounded textual projection of actual combined child output, not a compiler-native protocol. raw/raw_truncated retain captured bytes; truncation and independent adapter failure remain explicit. Effects may have applied once a child started.",
